    "statement": "If two proteins have identical native structures and identical residue sequences, then their TM-scores to any third reference structure are equal.",
    "motivation": "A stronger repair that implies length equality and also addresses potential superposition ambiguities from sequence differences. More restrictive but biologically relevant.",
    "depends_on": [
      "O1",
      "O4"
    ],
    "factor_sequence": [
      "O1",
      "O4"
